"42f9f6cefffcfe9177df073df1b43f5892c42de4": {"body":"Additive in data/agents/now.json: flags.snapshot_age_min (build time minus\nthe newer snapshot's updated), snapshot_newest, stale_after_min = 20;\ncommits_stale is also true past 20 min, so the panel shows the latest pushes\nand the age, not a count for the hour that would be too low. Nothing reads\ngit history at build. incident.weather@ told first (988c05e reads it).","session":"session_018yvwtLe9Px9Ni7aTs4AbYs","files":[{"p":"agents/observability/status.json","a":3,"d":3},{"p":"app/agents/now.js","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"app/agents/now.md","a":3,"d":3},{"p":"data/agents/commits.json","a":24,"d":25},{"p":"data/agents/count.json","a":3,"d":3},{"p":"data/agents/detail-2026-11-11T15.json","a":8,"d":1},{"p":"data/agents/index.json","a":25,"d":17},{"p":"data/agents/sessions.json","a":74,"d":35},{"p":"tools/agents-now.mjs","a":7,"d":3}],"more_files":0},
